        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>中小学教师类（D类）</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px;\n    background-color: #f3e9c9;\n    background-image:\n      linear-gradient(#e8d9a8 1px, transparent 1px),\n      linear-gradient(90deg, #e8d9a8 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 20px 20px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  .card {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 500px;\n    background-color: #fdf6ea;\n    border: 6px solid #6b3a2a;\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    padding: 45px 30px 40px 45px;\n    box-shadow: 4px 6px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n  }\n\n  /* spiral binding */\n  .spiral {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: -14px;\n    top: 30px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 26px;\n  }\n  .spiral span {\n    width: 26px;\n    height: 26px;\n    background: #fdf6ea;\n    border: 5px solid #6b3a2a;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  /* title banner */\n  .title-banner {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -30px;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translateX(-50%);\n    background-color: #e8544f;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    padding: 12px 30px;\n    border: 4px solid #6b3a2a;\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    z-index: 2;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .pencil-icon {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 10px;\n    left: 8px;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    color: #6b3a2a;\n    transform: rotate(-25deg);\n    z-index: 1;\n  }\n\n  .content {\n    margin-top: 25px;\n    color: #4a3222;\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n    line-height: 2.1;\n  }\n\n  .section-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    margin: 14px 0 6px 0;\n  }\n\n  .dotted-line {\n    border-bottom: 2px dotted #c9b896;\n    padding-bottom: 6px;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n\n  .bullet-item {\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 20px;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .bullet-item::before {\n    content: \"▶\";\n    color: #e8544f;\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 2px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n  }\n\n  b { font-weight: bold; color: #3a2818; }\n\n  .footnote {\n    text-align: right;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #b48a5a;\n    margin-top: 18px;\n  }\n\n  /* side tabs (sticky notes) */\n  .tab {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: -10px;\n    width: 34px;\n    height: 44px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    box-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n  }\n  .tab-pink {\n    top: 155px;\n    background-color: #f4a6b7;\n    transform: rotate(6deg);\n  }\n  .tab-yellow {\n    top: 205px;\n    background-color: #f5c96a;\n    transform: rotate(-6deg);\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"card\">\n  <div class=\"spiral\">\n    <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>\n    <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>\n    <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pencil-icon\">&#9998;</div>\n\n  <div class=\"title-banner\">中小学教师类（D类）</div>\n\n  <div class=\"tab tab-pink\"></div>\n  <div class=\"tab tab-yellow\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"section-title\">(一)科目</div>\n    <div class=\"dotted-line\">\n      教育系统事业单位考试整体来说考试形式为公共科目+专业知识。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bullet-item dotted-line\">\n      <b>公共科目包括:</b>教育基础知识:教育学、心理学或教育心理学、教育法律法规、新课改或公共基础知识（事业单位考试中的公基）。心理学与教育心理学并不相同，心理学通常称为普通心理学，教育心理学简称为教心。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bullet-item dotted-line\">\n      <b>专业学科:</b>一般来说一部分考核学科基础知识，另外一部分考核教学知识（教学设计、教学实施、教学评价）。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\">(二)题型</div>\n    <div class=\"dotted-line\">\n      教育理论知识的题型分为客观题和主观题两大类型。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bullet-item dotted-line\">\n      客观题主要是指单选题、多选题、不定项选择题、判断题、填空题等；\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bullet-item\">\n      主观题主要包括名词解释题、辨析题、简答题、论述题、材料/案例分析题、教学设计题（活动设计题）等。<b>一般地域不同,题型也有所区别。</b>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"footnote\">*线上课程面向22岁及以上</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
